`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go` has `RunOnce` to rebuild memo payloads in batches, but it is **never started as a background job**. Only `RebuildMemoPayload` is called during memo create/update:

- `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:108`, `:447` — inline calls
- No `memopayload.NewRunner(...).Run(...)` anywhere outside tests

